    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free 4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.0 for a large-cap E&P -> cost of equity ~9.3%; pre-tax debt ~5.2% (A-rated), ~35% blended tax -> ~3.4%; market-value weights ~87/13 -> WACC ~8.5%, rounded up to 9.0% for the depleting-asset nature of reserves. Same 9.0% on all three scenarios: commodity risk is carried in the scenario flows and weights, not stacked on the discount rate (charge risk once).",
